          "title": "Membership is Ownership: A Robust Ownership Verification Framework for Diffusion Models",
          "title_zh": "成员即所有权：一种面向扩散模型的鲁棒所有权验证框架",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28929v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_top",
          "organization": "OpenAI",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2608.28929",
          "summary": "Proposes MiO, a diffusion-model ownership verification framework built on population-level hypothesis testing over a private member evidence dataset, combining membership-inference attribution with separation from public references at p<10^-6. Evaluated on DDIM and Stable Diffusion without altering the owner model or sampling pipeline, it reports stability under post-theft fine-tuning and weight perturbation relative to watermarking baselines.",
