          "title_zh": "设计的是身份，偶然泄漏的是人口属性：行为生物特征嵌入中的群体属性泄漏与抑制",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28921v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2608.28921",
          "summary": "Presents a systematic audit of demographic leakage in behavioral biometric authentication, evaluating 11 models on 9 datasets across four biometric modalities and benchmarking four post-hoc suppression methods. Leakage and suppressibility vary substantially by modality, with voice embeddings leaking heavily but being suppressible, while keystroke and touchstroke embeddings leak less yet are harder to sanitize.",
