          "summary": "Analyzes hidden-state probes for LLM hallucination detection across three 7B-scale models and three datasets in a paired-example paradigm, finding the signal is dominated by a single mean-shift direction whose removal collapses detection to chance. A simple L2-regularized logistic regression reaches 0.952 AUROC, and the LayerMix aggregation matches oracle-layer performance without oracle access.",
